ode its born to reaching the destination node. The packet process will be able to simulate both interest and data packet experience. It can clone, time out and route itself to destination.   The other process in the system would be the generator process, which wakes up after a particular time and generates a random interest packet. The Generator process will assign a random node as the birth node and an object ID that belongs to another node. Generator process then activates this packet and puts itself to sleep for a random time. ","topics":[],"score":181254,"global_rank":414438},{"name":"Helithumper/Brain-Project","owner":"Helithumper","html_url":"https://github.com/Helithumper/Brain-Project","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Arduino","description":"An Arduino project that displays activity across neurons","topics":[],"score":181253,"global_rank":414439},{"name":"weiser/screen_and_we","owner":"weiser","html_url":"https://github.com/weiser/screen_and_we","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"create a pair-programming session via `screen`","topics":[],"score":181253,"global_rank":414440},{"name":"jfindlay/salt-pillar","owner":"jfindlay","html_url":"https://github.com/jfindlay/salt-pillar","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"SaltStack","description":"repo for testing salt git pillar","topics":[],"score":181253,"global_rank":414442},{"name":"mapsam/cs61as","owner":"mapsam","html_url":"https://github.com/mapsam/cs61as","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Scheme","description":"UC Berkeley: CS 61AS Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs","topics":[],"score":181253,"global_rank":414459},{"name":"brookr/apple-t-and-c","owner":"brookr","html_url":"https://github.com/brookr/apple-t-and-c","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181252,"global_rank":414461},{"name":"dj0894/FinalProjectWriteup","owner":"d